urldatachangestate:
Log action recording a change to a URL's live state. urlmetaobject is the formatted source link; logfrom and logto are the old and new translated state names, respectively.

Parameters are inserted by IABot, not MediaWiki template calls. Keep each complete token unchanged, including its English name and double braces; it may be repositioned where grammar allows:
* <nowiki>{{urlmetaobject}}</nowiki>: the already formatted original-source link.
* <nowiki>{{logfrom}}</nowiki>: the previous value (except in permission-change messages, where it is the list of added permissions).
* <nowiki>{{logto}}</nowiki>: the new value (except in permission-change messages, where it is the list of removed permissions).

Contains HTML. Translate visible prose and link labels while preserving the markup, link destinations, and substitutions. Do not replace HTML formatting with wiki markup.

The old and new values use these translated state names:
* {{msg-wm|Iabot-dead}}
* {{msg-wm|Iabot-dying}}
* {{msg-wm|Iabot-alive}}
* {{msg-wm|Iabot-unknown}}
* {{msg-wm|Iabot-paywall}}
* {{msg-wm|Iabot-blacklisted}}
* {{msg-wm|Iabot-whitelisted}}

languageunavailableheader:
